{
  "name": "Daily AI news digest from Google News to Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3c62b1d9-5e3f-4c70-9621-7018e4b68eff",
      "name": "Every morning at 8",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4c40d393-4659-4d3b-a73f-a4f7ea3b55a9",
              "name": "keywords",
              "value": "openai, nvidia",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "41c51e22-ada0-4690-998d-7b47ede8a533",
              "name": "region",
              "value": "US:en",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "991ae474-efd5-4838-8570-470c2e4a981e",
              "name": "maxArticles",
              "value": 10,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "b1a7760d-296c-46fe-9c22-d0ea8467b3ae",
              "name": "language",
              "value": "English",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d3a44380-ae82-450b-9a5f-2ae67d079661",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "YOUR_CHAT_ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "19da3e0a-8d30-4531-b45a-5ba1864cc136",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/data_xplorer~google-news-scraper-fast/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ keywords: $json.keywords.split(\",\").map(k => k.trim()).filter(k => k), timeframe: \"1d\", region_language: $json.region, maxArticles: Number($json.maxArticles), decodeUrls: true, extractDescriptions: true, extractImages: false, extractFullText: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "6be55cd2-83f7-42c0-aaf4-1a1ab8f5da5d",
      "name": "Run Google News (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Apify (Header Auth)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Builds one prompt with every article (title, source, URL and the start of the text).\nconst s = $('Settings').first().json;\nconst articles = $input.all().map((i) => i.json).filter((a) => a.title);\nconst blocks = articles.map((a, i) => `[${i + 1}] ${a.title}\\nSource: ${a.source || '?'} | ${a.publishedAt || ''}\\nURL: ${a.url}\\n`\n  + `${(a.fullText || a.description || '').slice(0, 1500)}`);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  count: articles.length,\n  prompt: `You write a short daily news digest in ${s.language} for the topics: ${s.keywords}.\\n`\n    + `Group related articles, keep the 5 to 8 most important stories, one or two sentences each, `\n    + `and end each story with its source and URL. Plain text, no markdown tables, under 3,000 characters.\\n\\n`\n    + `Articles of the last 24 hours:\\n\\n${blocks.join('\\n\\n')}`,\n} }];"
      },
      "id": "cab1e413-5d5e-454d-b6b4-47ca525b939e",
      "name": "Build the prompt",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.prompt }}"
      },
      "id": "ec6d6db3-6a7c-48cd-a0eb-53bcca8e1795",
      "name": "Write the digest",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e2c42bac-6612-4990-a540-3166814ff08e",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        520
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Telegram messages are limited to 4,096 characters.\nconst s = $('Settings').first().json;\nconst body = String($json.text || '').trim();\nconst head = `🗞️ Daily news digest: ${s.keywords}\\n\\n`;\nreturn [{ json: { text: (head + body).slice(0, 4000) } }];"
      },
      "id": "40e2b981-e3e1-4939-b43e-631d33b3cd31",
      "name": "Format the message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "disable_web_page_preview": true
        }
      },
      "id": "8d261a24-1101-477a-afae-41099dd03017",
      "name": "Send to Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "06aa4fcb-99e5-4c7c-89f9-159186928f35",
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Daily AI news digest\nEvery morning, gets the last 24 hours of Google News for your keywords with the full article text, asks an OpenAI model for a short digest and sends it to Telegram.\n\n## Setup\n1. **Run ... (Apify)** node: create a *Header Auth* credential, name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` (free account at apify.com, token in Settings > API & Integrations).\n2. **Send to Telegram**: add your bot credential.\n3. **Settings**: put your Telegram chat ID and your own values.\n4. *Test workflow*, then *Activate*.\n5. **OpenAI Chat Model**: add your OpenAI key, or swap in any other chat model node.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "acfec229-40b2-4bb4-808c-4b9980949f8f",
      "name": "Note -480",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
